{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to \u201c<strong>Possible One</strong>,\u201d the ultimate realistic colony management RTS set on the moon! Lead the development of the first industrial lunar colony, using proven real-world technologies to manage a profitable enterprise on the moon. Become not only self-sustaining, but also profitable to your board of directors back on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276770/extras/84b3b6796c9464cc4890a8a59c19da4c.avif?t=1755447812\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD AND PLAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excavate valuable resources and precious metals from beneath the lunar dust in terrain-challenging mining operations and turn them into profitable products. Build and maintain a lunar mining operation capable of surviving amid the harsh conditions of outer space. Plan out the literal foundations of the colony\u2019s quickly growing structures and facilities, from housing and workplaces to labs and manufacturing plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276770/extras/efaa74833d0628a2ff3c809304e8666c.avif?t=1755447812\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW AND EXPAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies and upgrades, and protect the colony against physical perils like radiation exposure, the difficulties of low-gravity living, and the psychological impact of living so far from Earth. Navigate the immediate needs and demands of the colony, and the complex political landscape of space trade as the colony\u2019s reputation grows back on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276770/extras/2ac9f9322f0a0edab61a840742085090.avif?t=1755447812\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TO A POSSIBLE TOMORROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its deep gameplay, rich strategy, and immersive world-building, &quot;Possible One&quot; is a must-play for any fan of space simulators and colony management games. Join the ranks of the space-faring elite and write yourself into tomorrow\u2019s interplanetary legacy today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2276770?t=1755447812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755447812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276770/76d8491a2bdab780c11a9d4d9c42cdb3e70ec5bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755447812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276770/76d8491a2bdab780c11a9d4d9c42cdb3e70ec5bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755447812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to \u201c<strong>Possible One</strong>,\u201d the ultimate realistic colony management RTS set on the moon! Lead the development of the first industrial lunar colony, using proven real-world technologies to manage a profitable enterprise on the moon. Become not only self-sustaining, but also profitable to your board of directors back on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta